{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1000_p", "source_sha256": "094aa17f7f155f3511850196c2d120736835c81757bebe2b1c8e60a4cdcaf078", "ja": "（『アイドル水着大運動会』の打ち合わせは順調だ。\nこの時期に相応しい、ホットな内容になりそうだな！）", "zh": "（《偶像泳装大运动会》的筹备会议进展顺利。看来会是非常符合这个季节的火热内容！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1001_p", "source_sha256": "557f3ed7013031c664520d083351ed44d5f65823449109677df8e93b968f46a0", "ja": "さて、海風で涼んでから劇場の中に戻ろうと\n思ったけど……やっぱり暑いな……。", "zh": "好了，吹吹海风凉快一下再回剧场吧……不过，果然还是很热啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ffdf62e9f6042a6bcfcfae2ad696a40676a58174ba4984a921e6c69417be9c0d", "ja": "当たり前です。真夏の炎天下に路上で涼めるはずが\nありません。早く劇場の中にお入りくださいまし。", "zh": "那是当然的。在大夏天的烈日下，怎么可能在路边乘得了凉。请您快点回剧场里面去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1003_p", "source_sha256": "332721f79a9730924fe2f13fb7b2de31c7e438423cf02f4edd8ae4e3a7d54bf2", "ja": "紬？　お疲れ様。確かにそうみたいだけど、\nそういう紬は戻らないのか？", "zh": "紬？辛苦了。确实好像是这样，不过你不回去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8be60b0087cd4f13a67397e9c025dc8b9be7c3b2123e644250d0cd36aae9f372", "ja": "私は劇場の周りを走りに出てきたところです。\nまず体力をつけないことには始まりませんから。", "zh": "我刚才出来在剧场周围跑步。毕竟，不先锻炼体力的话，就什么都做不成。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b6bcd11b2d83510755f0bbc13c354cccfa51bce8a0b820709a6464d7e55f6e46", "ja": "今度の運動会に向けて、高坂さんと一緒に\nレッスンしてみて、改めて痛感しました。", "zh": "为了迎接这次的运动会，和高坂同学一起练习之后，\n我再次深切地感受到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "978f821ce158146a7414dbceefe5969c555d474ea2f469b18f3370678f55de36", "ja": "私には……、体力がありませんっ！", "zh": "我……没有体力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1007_p", "source_sha256": "086f4b1427b90e96f060c39e3c2235fd08d11e80f127d59c37d021e5af52d809", "ja": "（海美や昴と比べるのが、そもそも……。\nいや、今は言うタイミングじゃなさそうだ）", "zh": "（本来就不该拿我和海美、昴比……\n不，现在还不是说这个的时候）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "37344874a86a35a389c039b355f9a39fc612817848d1c1cbde3e9bab30a1bd4f", "ja": "今回は勝負ではありませんが、チームを代表するのは\n同じです。みっともない姿は見せられません。", "zh": "这次虽然不是比赛，但代表团队这一点并没有改变。不能让大家看到丢人的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1009_p", "source_sha256": "44891801b0b75e992c291897dab36da55f99f2ff9b54f54b10c1afa1ede86c62", "ja": "確かに、水中は普段より体力を使うし、いいと思うよ。\nでももうひとつ、忘れないでほしいことがある。", "zh": "确实，在水中比平时更消耗体力，我觉得这个想法很好。\n不过还有一件事，希望你不要忘记。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f9d41050733fe6b9f0ae7108816030da3b1e166fc5f896e373f1a51c195aa531", "ja": "？　いえ、今日の私は、忘れ物なんて……？", "zh": "咦？不是，我今天应该没忘带什么东西吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1011_p", "source_sha256": "04b9aed88ac88441af07740a62aeb132d67148a1e3fb7991351202d22e243b6c", "ja": "いや、忘れ物ではなく。今度の運動会で\n一番大事なのは、一生懸命に楽しむことだから。", "zh": "不是，我的意思不是忘带东西。因为下次的运动会上，最重要的是尽情享受、全力以赴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2363bdb10f6909a8c3707d9e36eb888eb7c2244cae24560bb63e45df77148e98", "ja": "一生懸命に……。", "zh": "竭尽全力……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f256e9a7ad2a8cd52305db0203a6cb15bc2e4862323a9ad0e571395c90c1c0a1", "ja": "一生懸命に頑張って、勝ったり負けたりを楽しんで。\nそういう姿で、お客さんを笑顔にしてほしい。", "zh": "拼尽全力……享受胜负交替的过程。  \n希望你能以那样的姿态，让观众露出笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4158c3169ab469facdbe2006f39e28cb2bbcbe8288dd9f07d2ef31fa9c82f5fe", "ja": "紬は別にスポーツ選手じゃないんだ。\n紬は、アイドルだからな。", "zh": "紬又不是运动员。紬是偶像啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "902e94936c94a2873f8693f17109ab11f598448372b031fe0ed4bf9270b176f4", "ja": "……っ。", "zh": "……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7a0919a112cfc1e8b04824a23edf56c02b7c197e7f7ec943f8f407e35eb0b84f", "ja": "そ、そんなこと……、わかっています。\n忘れるわけがありません。", "zh": "这、这种事……我明白。\n怎么可能忘记。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e28aceb73f998c0b434cecfe08b118f0d396a0d9cc8a71e080a12e116fa6f805", "ja": "私は……アイドルです。\nそれは私の、一番の、大事なことですから。", "zh": "我……是偶像。\n因为那是对我来说，最重要、最珍贵的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e48758fc85bc993454cbecd98a6b8650431fc8bfbeac5aebb507c8423c39b62f", "ja": "そっか。なら、いいんだ。\n体力もつけつつ、思いっきり楽しもうな！", "zh": "这样啊。那就好。\n在增强体力的同时，也尽情享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0d987b806c437361f66d19d41c4fb510f6250d5a9643aec4797d7d06bc90a265", "ja": "はい。ではアイドルとして楽しむために……。\n早速、体力をつけてきます！", "zh": "好的。那么，为了以偶像的身份享受其中……我这就去锻炼体力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ca75f1ea179eacac227b64a3d2c844e17895a6745f5336e909e86d56baf7e64c", "ja": "え？　いや、だから、そうではなく……。", "zh": "咦？不是，我的意思不是那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2a72879518ba5343a2a0b8ce7b995c00dc3849070890695cc44e8b6908a47371", "ja": "そうなのですっ！\n仰る通り、勝ったり負けたりは楽しいでしょう。", "zh": "就是这样！\n正如您所说，有输有赢确实很开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6295a601ad27796be249ef7694ad9eb94015f5ee6eed5350255203674289d2cf", "ja": "ですが負けたり負けたりでは、申し訳なさすぎて！\n到底心から楽しめるものではありませんっ！", "zh": "可是如果总是输、总是输，实在太过意不去了！根本不可能发自内心地享受其中！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1023_p", "source_sha256": "7aab6d27382ff11de91fd4510baf856aa3f1e8c96d5cc0b6435b23fb05374bf2", "ja": "な、なるほど？　それはそう……か。", "zh": "原、原来如此？确实是这么回事……吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1024_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d0269e8873b539372b701a278d95770368f3c8efc378df85efd4d0a9776f8195", "ja": "せめて多少なりとも勝負になるように。\nそれでは、行ってまいります！", "zh": "至少也得多少有点一较高下的样子。\n那么，我这就去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0473_1025_p", "source_sha256": "33198864d108e4846d1104b1ac97ea967c521ad2ffdf3e1ea71856ad0d6bb080", "ja": "ああ、気を付け……って、この炎天下で！？\n待つんだ紬！　運動はレッスンルームで頼む！", "zh": "啊，路上小心……等等，你要在这种烈日下！？  \n等一下，紬！运动请到练习室进行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
